# PR body sidecars used as drafts during release work (PR_BODY_V018.md,
# PR_BODY_V019_BUMP.md, …). They live next to the repo so we can grep
# past drafts, but they should never get committed — the canonical
# copy of every PR body is in the GitHub PR conversation itself.
PR_BODY_*.md
